# On the phone in Russian: алло́, перезвоню́
subtitle: "Get through a phone call in Russian: алло́ and э́то Ма́ша, a line that's за́нято or не слы́шно, перезвоню́ to call back, and a сообще́ние instead."
tags: ["russian","russian phone","phone calls","russian phrases","перезвонить"]
teaches: ["phrases/on-the-phone"]
thumb: "band \"Hello? I'll call you back\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Achird | Tom, a warm, easy-going English speaker who knows Russian well; friendly with Masha, clear and unhurried; says Russian words the way a native Russian speaker would","b":"gemini:Leda | a friendly young Russian woman from Moscow, natural and lively, speaks English with a light Russian accent and says Russian words natively; never exaggerated"}
next: {"title":"An eighth Russian story: Masha's day","href":"https://www.drawcast.app/#gh=hmelberg/drawcast-library/russian-from-zero/80-russian-review-8.cast"}

## On the phone in Russian: алло́, перезвоню́
level: basic

    icon masha size 140 set twemoji x 150 y 450 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman hidden true
    text masha_name "Masha" #8f887c x 150 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon tom size 140 set twemoji x 850 y 450 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    text tom_name "Tom" #8f887c x 850 y 340 font_size 32 hidden true
    icon ph0 size 130 set twemoji x 500 y 520 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
    text known1 "Я звоню́ ма́ме." say "Я звоню́ ма́ме." x 500 y 360 font_size 64 hidden true
    icon balloon_m size 90 set twemoji x 290 y 600 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon balloon_t size 90 set twemoji x 710 y 600 or ["right anger bubble"] icon_look picture of "speech balloon" hidden true
    icon ph size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 610 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
    text w_tel "телефо́н" say телефо́н x 500 y 490 font_size 56 hidden true
    text w_allo "Алло́!" say Алло́! x 500 y 375 font_size 72 hidden true
    text w_eto "Э́то Ма́ша." say "Э́то Ма́ша." say_voice b x 500 y 255 font_size 60 hidden true
    text w_zv "звоню́" #8f887c say звоню́ x 500 y 620 font_size 48 hidden true
    text w_pere "перезвоню́" say перезвоню́ colors {"^пере":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 500 font_size 84 hidden true
    text w_like "как прочита́ю, напишу́" #8f887c x 500 y 385 font_size 40 hidden true
    text w_req1 "перезвони́!" say перезвони́! colors {"^пере":"#8a5fa8"} x 330 y 270 font_size 52 hidden true
    text w_req2 "перезвони́те!" say перезвони́те! colors {"^пере":"#8a5fa8"} x 670 y 270 font_size 52 hidden true
    icon ph2 size 120 set twemoji x 330 y 520 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
    icon busy size 70 set twemoji x 330 y 520 or ["prohibited"] icon_look picture of "no entry" hidden true
    text w_zan "За́нято." say За́нято. x 640 y 520 font_size 76 hidden true
    icon wc size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 320 or ["restroom","door"] icon_look picture of toilet hidden true
    text wc_sign "за́нято" #8f887c x 640 y 320 font_size 40 hidden true
    icon env size 110 set twemoji x 230 y 300 or ["e-mail","speech balloon"] icon_look picture of envelope hidden true
    text w_soob "Напишу́ сообще́ние." say "Напишу́ сообще́ние." x 590 y 300 font_size 56 hidden true
    icon mute size 110 set twemoji x 500 y 600 or ["speaker low volume","ear"] icon_look picture of "muted speaker" hidden true
    text w_sl "Том, тебя́ не слы́шно!" say "Том, тебя́ не слы́шно!" say_voice b x 500 y 470 font_size 62 hidden true
    text w_cold "тебя́ = you (can't be heard)" #8f887c x 500 y 360 font_size 40 hidden true
    dialogue talk speakers.a tom speakers.b masha turns [{"by":"a","text":"Алло́, Ма́ша? Э́то Том.","gloss":"Hello, Masha? It's Tom."},{"by":"b","text":"Том, тебя́ не слы́шно!","gloss":"Tom, I can't hear you!"},{"by":"a","text":"А сейча́с? Я звони́л, но бы́ло за́нято.","gloss":"And now? I called, but it was busy."},{"by":"b","text":"Сейча́с слы́шно. Я звони́ла ма́ме.","gloss":"Now I can hear you. I was phoning Mum."},{"by":"a","text":"Хорошо́. Ты свобо́дна в суббо́ту?","gloss":"Good. Are you free on Saturday?"},{"by":"b","text":"Не зна́ю. Я должна́ идти́. Я перезвоню́ за́втра!","gloss":"I don't know. I have to go. I'll call back tomorrow!"},{"by":"a","text":"И́ли напиши́ мне сообще́ние. Пока́!","gloss":"Or send me a message. Bye!"}] practice true size 1.5 hidden true
    text bylo "бы́ло за́нято  ·  бы́ло тепло́" say "бы́ло за́нято, бы́ло тепло́" x 500 y 640 font_size 46 hidden true
    icon q_ring size 160 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["mobile phone"] icon_look picture of telephone hidden true
    icon q_ph size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone" hidden true
    icon q_nurse size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 480 or ["health worker"] icon_look picture of "woman health worker" hidden true
    icon q_hosp size 150 set twemoji x 620 y 480 or ["building"] icon_look picture of hospital hidden true
    icon q_mute size 150 set twemoji x 500 y 480 or ["ear"] icon_look picture of "muted speaker" hidden true
    icon q_tom size 150 set twemoji x 380 y 480 or ["person"] icon_look picture of man hidden true
    icon q_cal size 140 set twemoji x 620 y 480 or ["sun"] icon_look picture of sunrise hidden true
    text b1 "алло́  ·  за́нято  ·  не слы́шно" say "алло́, за́нято, не слы́шно" x 500 y 520 font_size 52 hidden true
    text b2 "перезвоню́  ·  сообще́ние" say "перезвоню́, сообще́ние" colors {"^пере":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 400 font_size 52 hidden true

A: Я звоню́ ма́ме: you've said that since lesson 57. Today, the call itself: what you say once someone answers.
    draw tom tom_name ph0 known1

    erase ph0 known1

A: Listen first: Masha phones me at work.
    draw masha masha_name

B: Алло́, Том? Э́то Ма́ша.
    draw balloon_m caption false

    erase balloon_m

A: Ма́ша, я в ба́нке, на рабо́те. Я перезвоню́ ве́чером!
    draw balloon_t caption false

    erase balloon_t

    ask "When will he call back?" voice a options ["in the morning","this evening","on Saturday"] correct 2
        gloss: Masha, I'm at the bank, at work. I'll call back this evening!
        listen: Ма́ша, я в ба́нке, на рабо́те. Я перезвоню́ ве́чером!
        right: This evening: ве́чером. Перезвоню́ is I'll call back.
        wrong: Listen for the last word: the time of day.

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

A: The phone itself is easy: телефо́н.
    draw ph w_tel

A: Алло́ (@draw w_allo@) is hello, but only on the phone: you say it when (@highlight ph color #5b8c5a@) you pick up, and to start a call.

B: Э́то Ма́ша.
    draw w_eto

A: Then э́то and your name: this is Masha. No я, just э́то.
    highlight w_eto color #5b8c5a part Э́то effect underline

    erase ph w_tel w_allo w_eto

A: Перезвоню́ is (@draw w_zv@) звоню́ with (@draw w_pere@) пере in front: again, back.

A: And like (@draw w_like@) прочита́ю, it's a done verb, so on its own it means (@highlight w_pere color #5b8c5a effect underline@) will: I'll call back.

A: To ask for a call back, make the request, as in (@draw w_req1@) lesson 66: перезвони́! To someone you call (@draw w_req2@) вы, перезвони́те.

    erase w_zv w_pere w_like w_req1 w_req2

A: That evening I call Masha back, (@draw ph2 busy w_zan@) and hear beep, beep, beep: за́нято. Busy.

A: За́нято means taken: it's (@draw wc wc_sign@) also the word on a locked toilet door.

    erase wc wc_sign

A: So I write instead: напишу́ сообще́ние, I'll send a message.
    draw env w_soob

    erase ph2 busy w_zan env w_soob

A: Then I try again, and the line crackles.
    draw mute

B: Том, тебя́ не слы́шно!
    draw w_sl

A: Не слы́шно: it can't be heard. And тебя́ is the one (@draw w_cold@) who can't be heard, so тебя́ не слы́шно means I can't hear you.
    highlight w_sl color #5b8c5a part "не слы́шно" effect underline

    erase mute w_sl w_cold

A: Now the whole evening call. Listen; after it, the Practise (@highlight tom masha color #5b8c5a@) button lets you take a part yourself.
    show tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    draw talk

    erase talk

A: Бы́ло за́нято, it was busy: бы́ло, as in бы́ло тепло́.
    draw bylo

    erase bylo

    hide tom tom_name masha masha_name

    draw q_ring

    quiz "The phone rings and you pick it up. What do you say first?" reveal.text Алло́! reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        intro: Five questions now, then your score.
        right: Алло́: hello, on the phone.
        wrong: The phone's own hello.
        * Пока́!
        + Алло́!
        * Перезвоню́!

    erase q_ring

    draw q_ph

    quiz "You call, and hear beep, beep, beep: the line is busy. Which word is that?" reveal.text За́нято. reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        right: За́нято: busy, taken.
        wrong: The word on a locked toilet door too.
        * Не слы́шно.
        * Сообще́ние.
        + За́нято.

    erase q_ph

    draw q_nurse q_hosp

    quiz "A nurse at work answers: Я медсестра́, я в больни́це. She'll call you back this evening. What does she say?" reveal.text "Перезвоню́ ве́чером." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice a test t1
        right: Перезвоню́: I'll call back, a done verb.
        wrong: She will call back: пере, and the я form.
        + Перезвоню́ ве́чером.
        * Перезвони́ ве́чером.
        * Перезвони́ла ве́чером.

    erase q_nurse q_hosp

    draw q_mute

    ask "The line crackles. Tell your friend you can't hear them." say_it "Тебя́ не слы́шно!" gloss "I can't hear you!" voice b show cue reveal.text "Тебя́ не слы́шно!" reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 test t1

    erase q_mute

    draw q_tom q_cal

    ask "Now build a whole sentence. Type: I'll call back tomorrow." answer ["я перезвоню завтра","перезвоню завтра","завтра я перезвоню","завтра перезвоню"] reveal.text "Я перезвоню́ за́втра." reveal.at.x 500 reveal.at.y 290 reveal.style label reveal.size 60 reveal.color #3d3833 voice b test t1
        keys "АБВГДЕЁЖЗИЙКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ "
        right: Я перезвоню́ за́втра: the done verb already means will.
        wrong: Пере in front of звоню́, then за́втра.

    erase q_tom q_cal

    group board members ["b1","b2"]

A: You got {t1.score} of {t1.total}.
    results test t1 retry true pass 4

A: So a call: алло́ to start, за́нято and не слы́шно when it goes wrong, then перезвоню́, or a сообще́ние.
    highlight b1 b2 color #5b8c5a effect underline

    erase board

B: Перезвони́ мне! Пока́!
    icon end_masha size 170 set twemoji x 500 y 470 or ["girl"] icon_look picture of woman
    icon end_ph size 100 set twemoji x 640 y 470 or ["telephone"] icon_look picture of "mobile phone"
    text end_say "Перезвони́ мне! Пока́!" say "Перезвони́ мне! Пока́!" say_voice b colors {"^Пере":"#8a5fa8"} x 500 y 290 font_size 64

    erase end_masha end_ph end_say

A: Next time: a story. A day in Masha's life in Moscow.
    box next80 "Next: lesson 80 · Masha's day" x 500 y 430 width 680 height 130 radius 14 font_size 44

